Contra NES-X: Contra (Konami, NES, 1988) for the original Xbox.

Everything in this repository is the port's own code (src/, tools/,
setup.py, build.bat, Platform/), under the terms in LICENSE. The game itself
is not here: you supply your own cartridge as baserom.nes.

Third-party projects, fetched by setup.py at the revisions it pins, never
committed:

  vermiceli/nes-contra-us  https://github.com/vermiceli/nes-contra-us
                           The annotated disassembly of Contra (US), which
                           builds on Trax's disassembly. setup.py fetches it
                           into extern/nes-contra-us (DECOMP_REV) and
                           assembles the cartridge from it on your machine,
                           with the graphics and music its assets.txt takes
                           from your own baserom.nes, as its build scripts
                           do.
  cc65 2.19                https://github.com/cc65/cc65
                           The 6502 assembler (ca65) and linker (ld65) the
                           disassembly is built with. Fetched into
                           extern/cc65 (CC65_REV) and built into build/;
                           under its own licence (zlib).

The NES core in src/core/ is the port's own, written for this game: a 6502,
the 2C02 PPU, the 2A03's APU and the UxROM cartridge. The colours are worked
out from the 2C02's signal (tools/palette.py). tools/hosttest/cputest.c runs
Klaus Dormann's 6502 functional test (not included) against the CPU.

